# horcom
===
 Free, open source astrology program for Windows and Linux. Birth charts in seven house systems with topocentric parallax, transits, directions, solar and lunar returns, Munich rhythm theory. Robert Rettig's HORCOM (1989 to 2010), ported to C++20 and Qt 6..
